{'symbol': 'CME', 'date': '2023-01-04 07:30:00', 'title': 'CME GROUP REPORTS RECORD AVERAGE DAILY VOLUME OF 23.3 MILLION CONTRACTS TRADED IN 2022, AN INCREASE OF 19%', 'text': "-\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 EQUITY INDEX ADV GREW 39% FOR THE YEAR AND 26% IN Q4 -\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 INTEREST RATE ADV UP 18% ANNUALLY, DRIVEN BY RECORD SOFR VOLUME AND OI -\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 HIGHEST-EVER Q4 ADV CHICAGO , JAN. 4, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CME GROUP, THE WORLD'S LEADING DERIVATIVES MARKETPLACE, TODAY REPORTED ITS FULL-YEAR, Q4 AND DECEMBER 2022 MARKET STATISTICS, SHOWING IT REACHED A RECORD AVERAGE DAILY VOLUME (ADV) OF 23.3 MILLION CONTRACTS DURING THE YEAR, AN INCREASE OF 19% OVER 2021. ADV INCREASED 6% IN THE FOURTH QUARTER TO 21.8 MILLION CONTRACTS, AND ADV INCREASED 7% IN DECEMBER TO 19.2 MILLION CONTRACTS."}